  "interpretation_zh": "K16 已把观测 p90 降到 0.0473-0.0567，梯度 p90 也在门内，但 13 个标定组的场 p90 仍为 0.7252-0.7608，全部高于 0.50 门，因此 546 个单元和 13 个完整组仍为 0 通过。v207 不能被解释为当前流式 warm start 的外部失败或成功；在同一 straight-ray/网格/参考族下，比较基准本身不具备充分场精度。",
  "interpretation_en": "K16 reduces observation p90 to 0.0473-0.0567 and keeps gradient p90 within its gate, but field p90 remains 0.7252-0.7608 across all 13 calibration groups, above the 0.50 threshold. Consequently, all 546 cells and all 13 complete groups still fail. v207 therefore cannot be interpreted as either external failure or success of the streamed warm start: under the same straight-ray, grid, and reference family, the comparison reference itself lacks adequate field accuracy.",
  "route_action_zh": "关闭当前 Case 5 straight-ray/网格/零起点 CGLS K16 参考门，不运行 wall/RSS，不用更大模型或 GPU 挽救。只有新的物理信息或物理上不同且结果前冻结的充分参考，才值得重新建立外部门。",
  "route_action_en": "Close the current Case 5 gate under this straight-ray, grid, and zero-start CGLS K16 reference family. Do not run wall/RSS or rescue it with a larger model or GPU. Reopen an external gate only with new physical information or a physically distinct adequate reference frozen before results.",
